        <li>{L('口鼻不再用圓圈標，改成刻度：圓圈現在只代表一氧化碳。', 'Mouths are no longer ringed; they are ticks. A ring now only ever means carbon monoxide.')}</li>
        <li>{L('小學生畫成大約 120 公分，比嬰兒車那一段（55–85 公分）高。', 'The schoolchild is drawn about 120 cm tall, above the stroller band (55–85 cm).')}</li>
        <li>{L('過馬路的人畫成正面：他們是橫越鏡頭看過去的那條街。等在轉角的人和騎士維持側面。', 'People crossing are drawn from the front: they are crossing the street the camera looks along. People waiting on the corner, and riders, stay in profile.')}</li>
        <li>{L('每個車陣畫面裡有一位前排騎士看得到臉。騎士是人，不是「煙」。', 'One front-row rider in every pack frame has a visible face. Riders are people, not “the smoke”.')}</li>
        <li>{L('畫面是靜態的。沒有飄移、沒有噴煙、沒有會跑的倒數。', 'The scene is static. No drift, no puffs, no running countdown.')}</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

